# Code of Conduct

Everyone who takes part in this project, including issues, pull requests, discussions, and chat, is expected to be respectful and constructive.

## Expected behavior

- Be respectful and assume good intent.
- Give and accept constructive feedback.
- Keep discussion on the work, not on people.

## Unacceptable behavior

- Harassment, insults, or personal attacks.
- Publishing someone else's private information without permission.
- Posting credentials, tokens, or other secrets.
- Any conduct that would be out of place in a professional setting.

## Reporting

Report concerns privately to the StakeReloadXS maintainers through the official channels listed on the organization profile. Do not post them publicly.

## Enforcement

Maintainers may remove content, limit participation, or block accounts that break these standards.
